{"4201440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Monster Survival Shooter VR", "steam_appid": 4201440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Monster Survival Shooter VR, an intense action-packed experience where your skills will be pushed to the limit. Face off against terrifying enemies like Lycans, Ice Demons, Savage Bears, Trolls, Hellhounds, and other deadly fiends. Armed with pistols, shotguns, and rifles, you’ll fight through relentless waves of monsters. Stay sharp—creatures can strike from any angle, forcing you to always be on guard. But beware—some enemies are far stronger than others. Boss monsters will challenge your skills with epic battles that push you to the limit. Your survival depends on more than firepower: Checkpoints give you temporary access to weapons and health boosts. Health Band on your left arm lets you track your life in real time. Maximum kills is your ultimate goal—fight hard, survive longer, and set new records. Fast-paced, intense, and designed for pure action, Monster Survival Shooter VR is built for players who crave non-stop battles and heart-pounding survival challenges. Are you ready to test your limits against a monstrous invasion? Enter the arena. Face the beasts. Survive the rampage.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Monster Survival Shooter VR, an intense action-packed experience where your skills will be pushed to the limit. Face off against terrifying enemies like Lycans, Ice Demons, Savage Bears, Trolls, Hellhounds, and other deadly fiends. Armed with pistols, shotguns, and rifles, you’ll fight through relentless waves of monsters. Stay sharp—creatures can strike from any angle, forcing you to always be on guard. But beware—some enemies are far stronger than others. Boss monsters will challenge your skills with epic battles that push you to the limit. Your survival depends on more than firepower: Checkpoints give you temporary access to weapons and health boosts. Health Band on your left arm lets you track your life in real time. Maximum kills is your ultimate goal—fight hard, survive longer, and set new records. Fast-paced, intense, and designed for pure action, Monster Survival Shooter VR is built for players who crave non-stop battles and heart-pounding survival challenges. Are you ready to test your limits against a monstrous invasion? Enter the arena. Face the beasts. Survive the rampage.</p>", "short_description": "Face waves of deadly monsters in this fast-paced VR action shooter. Fight Lycans, Hellhounds, Trolls, and brutal bosses using pistols, shotguns, and rifles. Survive, break records, and push your limits.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201440/3cb74f0a6a44509a02083c16d30ff470261ff2f6/header.jpg?t=1768461846", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201440/4bf90b8039fab0559cafe07afbda67b068922dab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768461846", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201440/4bf90b8039fab0559cafe07afbda67b068922dab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768461846", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590/AMD FX 8350 equivalent or better<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970, AMD Radeon R9 290 equivalent or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVr</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br